  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 9704.03 Prohibited Costs",
  "priorExpiration": "2022-07-28",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 9704.03 Prohibited Costs.\n\n(a) The following shall be prohibited uses of the grant funds:\n\n(1) Supplanting locally budgeted and approved funds for items covered by this grant;\n\n(2) Any expenses incurred prior to or after the grant period identified in award documents;\n\n(3) Any expenses incurred under a contract that was in place prior to the grant award or after the grant period; and\n\n(4) Any expenses related to evidence rated analysis or redaction activities.\n\nSource. #13338, INTERIM, eff 1-29-22, EXPIRES: 7-28-22; ss by #13365, eff 4-18-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c9700.html"
}
